{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-manNeighborhood1-2344": "STAFF: 你们这一群，可真够热闹的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-manNeighborhood1-2345": "STAFF: 今天算了，没心情。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenCircle-2346": "MAN: 又老了一岁，身材可还保持得不错！",
  "line:07d083e": "MAN: 出来多走几步！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInn-2348": "Innkeeper: 住一晚只要二十瓦尔，怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInn-2349": "在旅馆休息",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInn-2350": "Innkeeper: 价钱就是这个价钱，得付足。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInn-2351": "不了，谢谢……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenGearWoman-2352": "WOMAN: 最近往东走的商队跟部落那边闹了些麻烦，反正他们买的装备是越来越多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenGearWoman-2353": "WOMAN: 我们主要往城外农场送货，偶尔也有城里的买家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenItemWoman-2354": "WOMAN: 有的东西涨价，有的降价，本来就是这么回事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenItemWoman-2355": "WOMAN: 想买便宜货，就得多跑几家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenItemMan-2356": "MAN: 现在啤酒都卖“六瓶装”了，不像以前，一次一罐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenItemMan-2357": "MAN: 谁知道在这里又能碰见什么新鲜东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenItemMan2-2358": "MAN: 晚上再来，把便宜货都拿下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInnManA-2359": "MAN: 这地方越来越没新意了……可实在方便。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInnManA-2360": "MAN: 现在喝酒太早？那得看喝什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInnManB-2361": "MAN: 小姐，好久没见你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInnManB-2362": "MAN: 你这个年纪来这里，是不是早了点？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-perotGuide-2363": "OLD MAN: 佩罗？他的店就在前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-perotGuide-2364": "OLD MAN: 我看佩罗的生意，光靠你一个人就养得活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-perotGuide-2365": "OLD MAN: 哦，又见到你了，真好！佩罗先生正找你呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-lastMinuteShopper-2366": "WOMAN: 亚历，你回来了？店里备货的事，你可得跟舅舅好好说说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-lastMinuteShopper-2367": "WOMAN: 聚会要用的，还差一样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-cleanersGuy-2368": "MAN: 漂白清洁剂？我那时候，都得自己买碱，自己调。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-cleanersGuy-2369": "MAN: 现在擦地的东西这么多……碱粉怎么就不行了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-produceLady-2370": "WOMAN: 这家店吸引人的，不就是冷藏地方够多，连软奶酪都能卖吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-produceLady-2371": "WOMAN: 我平时不是来买蔬果的，不过这些看着不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2372": "LOUIS: 我来照看店里，可冷藏库的事，我是真没办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2373": "LOUIS: 亚历！见到你真高兴！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2374": "LOUIS: 你看起来……跟以前不一样了，我是说，变得更好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2375": "LOUIS: 你……救了玛丽，对吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2376": "LOUIS: 我不知道你做了什么，可现在看着她……我知道，我熟悉的玛丽还在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2377": "LOUIS: 亚历，舅舅跟你说，经营一家店，总免不了这儿坏了、那儿出了毛病。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue-2378": "LOUIS: 你妈妈能一直把这家店撑下来，还经营得那么好，真是了不起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2379": "LOUIS: 我来照看店里，可冷藏库的事，我是真没办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2380": "LOUIS: 亚历！见到你真高兴！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2381": "LOUIS: 你看起来……跟以前不一样了，我是说，变得更好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2382": "LOUIS: 你……救了玛丽，对吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2383": "LOUIS: 我不知道你做了什么，可现在看着她……我知道，我熟悉的玛丽还在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2384": "LOUIS: 亚历，舅舅跟你说，经营一家店，总免不了这儿坏了、那儿出了毛病。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogue2-2385": "LOUIS: 你妈妈能一直把这家店撑下来，还经营得那么好，真是了不起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueFinale-2386": "LOUIS: 把那只鸟抓住，我得打烊了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueFinale2-2387": "LOUIS: 把那只鸟抓住，我得打烊了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-walkingGrandpa-2388": "OLD MAN: 哟，这不是亚历珊德拉吗！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-walkingGrandpa-2389": "OLD MAN: 你好啊，亚历珊德拉，今天大街上人太多，我就到这后头走走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideGrandma-2390": "OLD WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉！你没事真是太好了！我还担心你哥哥已经……唉，不说这个了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideGrandma-2391": "OLD WOMAN: 你好，亚历珊德拉！你为了撑起这家店有多辛苦，我都看在眼里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideGrandma-2392": "OLD WOMAN: 这个拿着，要照顾好身体。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideGrandma-2393": "获得恢复药！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-grandmasGirl-2394": "WOMAN: 居然有人要开一家舞厅，里面只放录好的音乐！这谁想得出来啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-grandmasGirl-2395": "WOMAN: 今天新开的屋顶花园有聚会，可还没人约我去……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideViewGrandma-2396": "OLD WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉！？哎呀，亲爱的！看见你平安，我真高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideViewGrandma-2397": "OLD WOMAN: 从这儿是看不清多少，可我的脚疼得受不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideViewGrandma-2398": "OLD WOMAN: 哦，亚历珊德拉？好姑娘，你妈妈的事，真让人难过。拿着这个，撑住啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideSetup1-2399": "MAN: 看着不乱，不代表就没乱子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideSetup1-2400": "MAN: 看来东西都齐了，难得准时了一回。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideSetup2-2401": "MAN: 得拿几个气瓶来，把这些充起来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideSetup3-2402": "WOMAN: 我一直都想给游行帮帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideDad-2403": "MAN: 什么叫“乖一点”，咱们说过多少次了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideDad-2404": "MAN: 我说了，等你妈妈，没得商量！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideKid1-2405": "BOY: 我乖不了！我太饿了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideKid1-2406": "BOY: 我要站近点，好看得见！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideKid2-2407": "GIRL: 我要上厕所。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-oldmanAa-2408": "OLD MAN: 还记得游行只有二十分钟的时候吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-oldmanAb-2409": "OLD MAN: 那时可没有花车、汽车这些东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideDate-2410": "YOUNG WOMAN: 那家伙到底去哪儿了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideLookerB-2411": "WOMAN: 嗯……真不想跟人挤位子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-wallsideLooker-2412": "WOMAN: 叫让和雷米给咱们腾个地方，不然他们还能派上什么用场？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideMan-2413": "MAN: 现在连电车司机工会都有花车了，还有什么体面可言？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideOldMan-2414": "OLD MAN: 要说石匠们“体面”，我可不认。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideOldWoman-2415": "OLD WOMAN: 游行就要开始了！活到这把年纪，我还是这么兴奋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideGirl-2416": "GIRL: 哦！快开始了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideGirl2-2417": "GIRL: 我想看乐队走过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideGirl3-2418": "GIRL: 还要多久？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideWoman-2419": "WOMAN: 姑娘，快找个位子！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideBoy-2420": "BOY: 嘿，亚历！今天不用干活吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideBoy2-2421": "BOY: 我不懂，不就是一群人沿着街走吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideBoy3-2422": "BOY: 他们真的会撒糖果吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopWoman-2423": "WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉，你妈妈怎么样了？你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopWoman-2424": "WOMAN: 可别挡着别人看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopWoman-2425": "WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉，亲爱的，你家里的事我都听说了，真替你难过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopWoman-2426": "WOMAN: 我年轻时也熬过一段苦日子，当时读了这本书，帮了我不少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopWoman-2427": "获得力量宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopMan-2428": "MAN: 物价一直涨，养老金却不动……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-outsideItemShopMan-2429": "MAN: 里面的东西什么时候变得这么贵了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestOldWoman-2430": "OLD WOMAN: 春天雨水太多，能有这么晴朗的夏天，真好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestOldWoman-2431": "OLD WOMAN: 哎呀，今天出来的人可真多，平时都快忘了这座城有多大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman-2432": "WOMAN: 听说很快每个街区都要通电话线了，想想看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman-2433": "WOMAN: 不是早该开始了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman2-2434": "WOMAN: 今天出来逛逛，日子挑得真好，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman2-2435": "WOMAN: 这阳光怎么晒都不够，真舒服！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman2a-2436": "MAN: 你好，小姑娘，好久不见！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman2a-2437": "MAN: 天上一朵云都没有！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman3-2438": "WOMAN: 好好看看吧，亲爱的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestWoman3-2439": "WOMAN: 啊，今天整座城都活起来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestBoy-2440": "BOY: 喂，喂！我什么都看不见！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestMan-2441": "MAN: 好吧……总算有地方站。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestMan2-2442": "MAN: 这些孩子早上六点就把我们叫起来占位子，现在又嫌等着无聊了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestMan3-2443": "MAN: 这场面可真热闹！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestOldMan-2444": "OLD MAN: 最近倒是安静多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestOldMan-2445": "OLD MAN: 吵得很！不过，我喜欢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southwestOldMan-2446": "OLD MAN: 连农民都特意进城来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldWoman-2447": "OLD WOMAN: 孙子孙女们竟说自己长大了，不该来公园了，哪有这种道理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldWoman-2448": "OLD WOMAN: 那场游行真了不起，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldWoman-2449": "OLD WOMAN: 老天，我这把年纪，可挤不动街上的人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldMan-2450": "OLD MAN: （悄悄告诉你，像我这样没了老伴的人，在这儿可容易认识年纪相仿的女士。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldMan-2451": "OLD MAN: 公园平时可比今天安静多了，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGirl1-2452": "GIRL: 男孩们还是那么烦……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGirl1-2453": "GIRL: 那些男孩真烦人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGirl2-2454": "GIRL: 希望他们别过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkBoy1-2455": "BOY: 听说前面那家店闹鬼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkBoy1-2456": "BOY: 到底什么时候开始啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkBoy2-2457": "BOY: 不行！得装作不在乎，女孩就喜欢这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkMan-2458": "MAN: 看着这些孩子，还挺开心的，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkWoman-2459": "WOMAN: 是啊，不过你可别忘了，要是再生一个，六年内咱们都别想来这种活动了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkOldMan2-2460": "OLD MAN: 孩子们，觉得怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGirl3-2461": "GIRL: 有点无聊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkBoy3-2462": "BOY: 风太大了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-girlRunning-2463": "GIRL: 哟呼！哦！小心！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-girlRunning-2464": "GIRL: 呃，能看着点脚下吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-centerOldMan-2465": "OLD MAN: 亲爱的，相信我，这里的位子最好，我小时候就常来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-centerOldWoman-2466": "OLD WOMAN: 你还记得那是多少年前的事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-centerMan-2467": "MAN: 不知道原先在期待什么，可这也太夸张了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketMan-2468": "MAN: 自己带啤酒来，就像个酒鬼；在游行现场买，倒又正常了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketMan2-2469": "MAN: 照理说该安排在午饭时候，还能多卖些面包和奶酪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketMan3-2470": "MAN: 好久不见，出来买东西啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketMan3-2471": "MAN: 天气真好，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketMan4-2472": "MAN: 小吃队伍再不快点，我这家怕是都要散了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketWoman-2473": "WOMAN: 至少游行还没开始。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketWoman2-2474": "WOMAN: 听说水果很新鲜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketWoman3-2475": "WOMAN: 但愿排这么久值得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketWoman4-2476": "WOMAN: 我还以为，今天会有更多店开门……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldMan-2477": "OLD MAN: 放假呢！慢慢来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldMan2-2478": "OLD MAN: 到了我这岁数，就不用着急了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldMan3-2479": "OLD MAN: 暖和得正好，膝盖都不疼了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldMan4-2480": "OLD MAN: 瞧瞧这场面！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldWoman-2481": "OLD WOMAN: 我就爱看孩子们跑来跑去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldWoman2-2482": "OLD WOMAN: 是亚历珊德拉呀？哎哟，你今天还得干活啊？可怜的孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketOldWoman3-2483": "OLD WOMAN: 太阳晒着倒是挺舒服。这风一吹，我就后悔没带围巾了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketGirl-2484": "GIRL: 啊，快点！我要上厕所！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketBoy-2485": "BOY: 我饿了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketBoy2-2486": "BOY: 能给我买面小旗子吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideWalkingMan-2487": "MAN: 小姑娘，注意点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westsideWalkingMan-2488": "MAN: 能让让吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopGirl-2489": "GIRL: 妈妈，来了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopWoman-2490": "WOMAN: 开始了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopWoman2-2491": "WOMAN: 佩罗先生现在偶尔也卖些个人装备了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopWoman2-2492": "WOMAN: 真是的，他一整场都错过了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopWoman2-2493": "WOMAN: 他去哪儿了？游行都快开始了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopWoman3-2494": "WOMAN: 还没呢，宝贝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopMan-2495": "MAN: 这些东西，本来是拿来干什么的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopMan2-2496": "MAN: 难得一回，可能准备过头了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopMan3-2497": "MAN: 我也等不及了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearshopMan4-2498": "MAN: 本来轮到我休息，不过看来他们需要帮手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-center2OldMan-2499": "OLD MAN: 到了我这年纪，出门可不能忘了墨镜或帽子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearPoorMan-2500": "POOR MAN: 这家店的东西，我一样都买不起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearCenterBoy-2501": "BOY: 游行里有大卡车吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gearCenterOldWoman-2502": "OLD WOMAN: 当然开门啦，这么好的客流，可不能错过！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gardenBoy-2503": "BOY: 能玩捉人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gardenMan-2504": "MAN: 现在不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gardenOldMan-2505": "OLD MAN: 要么我耳朵不好了，要么这条大街以前比现在吵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-gardenWoman-2506": "WOMAN: 啊，晒着太阳，整个人都精神了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-strollingMan-2507": "MAN: 今年更热一些，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-strollingMan-2508": "MAN: 刚才真精彩，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-strollingMan-2509": "MAN: 趁游行还没开始，先走上几步。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-strollingMan2-2510": "MAN: 想停下来，麻烦去别处吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-strollingMan2-2511": "MAN: 有些人还得在这条大街上好好走路呢……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southAlleyBoy-2512": "BOY: 别告诉爸爸我在哪儿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southAlleyMan-2513": "MAN: 真正好看的，是那些四处找位子的女士……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-southAlleyWoman-2514": "WOMAN: 你也得工作？这些活动，对咱们就只有添乱，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-northAlleyMan-2515": "MAN: 天天都有新的送货公司冒出来，而且大多还用上了新卡车……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-northAlleyMan-2516": "MAN: 今天就别指望送货了，我是没辙了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-northAlleyMan2-2517": "MAN: 看那个装着电线的，你祖父以前就在那个工会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-northAlleyBoy-2518": "BOY: 不用上学是好，可这也太无聊了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innOldWoman-2519": "OLD WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉？你妈妈有消息了吗？她以前总是那么有精神。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innOldWoman2-2520": "OLD WOMAN: 花车是比以前漂亮了，可这人也太多了，老天爷！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innMan-2521": "MAN: 我祖父参加过第一次追思日游行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innRichMan-2522": "RICH MAN: 这里有几辆花车，还是我赞助的呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innPoorMan-2523": "POOR MAN: 孩子一放假就让人头疼，好在还能带他们来这种活动，消磨消磨时间……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innBoy-2524": "BOY: 那么难过的事，为什么还要办游行？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innWoman-2525": "WOMAN: 还记得花车要靠马和牛拉的时候吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innMan2-2526": "MAN: 汽车尾气是讨厌，可至少不用事后拿铲子清理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-richhouseWoman-2527": "RICH WOMAN: 啊，我小时候，父亲也参加过这种游行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-richhouseMan-2528": "RICH MAN: 站到这儿，可真是挤进人堆里了，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-innBoy2-2529": "BOY: 好听的广播节目开始时，我放学总还没到家……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-paradeOrderWoman-2530": "WOMAN: 再来点香肠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-paradeHusband-2531": "MAN: 本来可以在家吃的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-paradeHusband-2532": "MAN: 现在我们老来这家，可明明两条街外就有更好的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet1-2533": "WOMAN: 工作？这种日子，不就是找个借口午饭喝点酒嘛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet2-2534": "WOMAN: 只要能不用上班、出来享受好天气，什么节日我都欢迎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet3-2535": "MAN: 说是纪念大灾变也好，纪念后来的重建也好，其实并没有非选哪一天不可的道理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet3-2536": "MAN: 依我看，他们就是等天气一暖和，大家能舒舒服服站在外头了，就挑一天来办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet4-2537": "OLD MAN: 都怪收音机，搞得现在的人站着等一会儿都没耐心了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet5-2538": "GIRL: 爷爷，我站累了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow1-2539": "MAN: 这个国家以前可是有两千万人呢，你敢相信？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow1-2540": "MAN: 都快一个半世纪了，人口还没完全恢复。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow1-2541": "MAN: 这个国家以前可是有两千万人呢，你敢相信？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow1-2542": "MAN: 都快一个半世纪了，人口还没完全恢复。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow2-2543": "WOMAN: 父亲以前开车带我们经过北方那些废弃农庄，多得数都数不清……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLow2-2544": "WOMAN: 父亲以前开车带我们经过北方那些废弃农庄，多得数都数不清……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-undercover1-2545": "MAN: 还得等一会儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-undercover2-2546": "MAN: 你先走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-nightTime1-2547": "MAN: 我们好久没这样在外面待一整夜了……久到我都不想说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-nightTime2-2548": "MAN: 不记得以前有这么冷……这么累。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueGrandpa-2549": "OLD MAN: 墙畔区居然也通电了，我到现在都不敢相信，毕竟我们这儿一向比城里别处落后好几年呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueGrandpa-2550": "OLD MAN: 这回，真是连我们也赶上新时代了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueMan-2551": "WOMAN: 你好，亚历珊德拉，看样子忙得够呛啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueGDirection-2552": "LADY: 达尔诺夫人就住那边，那栋大房子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueGDirection-2553": "LADY: 吉鲁夫人？就在下面，正从家里出来呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueGDirection-2554": "LADY: 天气真好，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-mrsGiroux-2555": "MRS. GIROUX: 快去忙吧，亲爱的，你肯定还有一大堆事呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-Celine-2556": "CELINE: 你们店里真有收音机吗？妈妈都不许我们家买呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueMan2-2557": "MAN: 你好，亚历。还撑得住吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-Durand-2558": "DURAND: 谢谢你把卡车修好，这东西好用的时候是福，坏起来就是祸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-mrsDurand-2559": "MRS. DURAND: 谢谢你，亚历，你妈妈帮过我们不少忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-mrsDurand-2560": "MRS. DURAND: （我会让丈夫记着这份情的。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueOldGuy1-2561": "OLD GUY: 还记得买牛奶得过河的时候吗？现在这边就能冷藏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-prologueOldGuy2-2562": "OLD GUY: 到处都是冰柜，现在连啤酒都是冰的了！冰啤酒啊，想想看！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-pShopLady-2563": "WOMAN: 现在能给我结账了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-pShopOldMan-2564": "OLD MAN: 答应给孙女买冰淇淋了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-pShopProduce-2565": "WOMAN: 我来买的是肉和乳制品，不是蔬果……可也没时间跑两家店。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-pShopDryGoods-2566": "OLD MAN: 唉，他们这儿总没有关节膏……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueHints-2567": "LOUIS: 我来看店，你快去看冷藏库！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueHints-2568": "LOUIS: 快把牛奶送到吉鲁夫人家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueHints-2569": "LOUIS: 亚历，去柜子里找找塑料袋！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-louisDialogueHints-2570": "LOUIS: 亚历，把肉送去达尔诺夫人家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memResponse1-2571": "WOMAN: 能安静点吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memResponse2-2572": "WOMAN: 现在是个庄重的时刻，没看出来吗……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memResponse3-2573": "WOMAN: 那些故事，我也不全信……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memResponse4-2574": "WOMAN: 刚才人可真多，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memOuter-2575": "MAN: 我父亲和祖父都是农民，我们住在村里时，每次都会参加这样的纪念仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memOuter-2576": "MAN: 发明那种新肥料以前，饥荒是常有的事，他们老是担心有一天也轮到自己家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memOuter-2577": "MAN: 我父亲和祖父都是农民，我们住在村里时，每次都会参加这样的纪念仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memOuter-2578": "MAN: 发明那种新肥料以前，饥荒是常有的事，他们老是担心有一天也轮到自己家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialUp1-2579": "WOMAN: 今年没有新雕像，仪式也就没上次那么盛大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialUp1-2580": "WOMAN: 哦，事情是……以前有过一段苦日子，地里长不出足够的粮食，死了很多人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialUp2-2581": "GIRL: 哎呀，大家都穿得好漂亮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialUp2-2582": "GIRL: 那他们为什么不去商店买？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenSweets-2583": "VENDOR: 巧克力，或者来块苹果挞！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenConstruction1-2584": "WORKER: 修下水道可得当心，没准儿就挖进一座古墓里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenNightMother-2585": "MOTHER: 我儿子最近老是很晚才回来……真希望能劝劝他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInsomnia-2586": "OLD MAN: 别管我……老了，睡不好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenInsomnia-2587": "OLD MAN: 你最近不也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-paradeWorker1-2588": "WORKER: 在为明天做准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-paradeWorker2-2589": "WORKER: 嗯？我们可不是熬夜，是起得早！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eggplantLady-2590": "WOMAN: 这里的奶酪向来不错，可这几根茄子，做不出什么好焗菜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGuard1-2591": "WOMAN: 自己找位子去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkGuard2-2592": "WOMAN: 能找到的位子里，就这里看得最清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastSideMan-2593": "MAN: 要铺电动街车线路？不会铺到我们这里吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastSideMan-2594": "MAN: 有座新纪念碑要揭幕？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastSideOldMan-2595": "OLD MAN: 嗯……等亲眼见了再信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastSideOldMan-2596": "OLD MAN: 不敢说自己弄明白了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet8-2597": "WOMAN: 那边聚了不少人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet9-2598": "WOMAN: 至少公园翻修了，是件好事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet10-2599": "WOMAN: 刚才实在待不下去，我先走开了，这些事还是在书上看看吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet11-2600": "WOMAN: 哦，是啊，我丈夫特别迷建筑，说起建筑来就没完没了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet12-2601": "BOY: 能玩捉人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet13-2602": "GIRL: 他们说了，不许出声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet14-2603": "BOY: 那我们悄悄地玩？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet15-2604": "BOY: 无聊死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet16-2605": "GIRL: 爸爸答应给我买冰淇淋，可等太久了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memStreet17-2606": "GIRL: 纪念碑是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance1-2607": "MAN: 塞伦夜曲团从不让人失望！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance2-2608": "MAN: 能安静点吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance3-2609": "OLD WOMAN: 哦，我的心都受不了了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance4-2610": "OLD MAN: 跟你说，这几个小伙子可真会唱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance5-2611": "BOY: 大家为什么都在唱歌？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance6-2612": "MAN: 我倒想安安静静喝酒，可有什么办法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-performance7-2613": "MAN: 是他们唱跑调了，还是我喝多了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-oldLadyBench-2614": "OLD WOMAN: 坐在这里，真安静，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-oldLadyBench-2615": "OLD WOMAN: 坐在这里，真安静，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-statueMan-2616": "MAN: 真难相信，这些事确实发生过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenNightBack2-2617": "ALEXANDRA: （得回店里了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenNightBack1-2618": "ALEXANDRA: （不……不是这边……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenNightBack1-2619": "ALEXANDRA: （得跟上阿尔文……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenButcher-2620": "BUTCHER: 来晚了，全给买空了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenButcher-2621": "BUTCHER: 这里要排队，知道吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenPotions-2622": "VENDOR: 要点什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-serenPotions-2623": "VENDOR: 请到前面来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-fortuneCustomer-2624": "LADY: 能告诉我，什么时候才能遇见命中注定的人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westwallsideMan-2625": "MAN: 亚历珊德拉！快去看看你舅舅和哥哥吧，他们可想你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westwallsideMan-2626": "MAN: 听说店里遇上麻烦了，总有事出岔子，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westwallsideOldWoman-2627": "OLD WOMAN: 亚历珊德拉？谢天谢地，你没事！总得有人把你家店里的货补齐！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-westwallsideOldWoman-2628": "OLD WOMAN: 店晚点会开门吗？我可能得买些冷冻食品。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-boyGate-2629": "BOY: 在这里好像勉强能看见……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-girlGate-2630": "GIRL: 喂！别挡着！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastManSeren-2631": "MAN: 真是吵死了，我只好躲到巷子里喘口气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-eastGirlSeren-2632": "GIRL: 爸爸不喜欢人多，可我想看游行！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-marketLittleGirl-2633": "GIRL: 他们说那么久，我们还得一直安静听着……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memGirlA-2634": "GIRL: 妈妈，那个老爷爷说的是真的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-speechGiver-2635": "SPEAKER: 我们不能忘记那些人，更不能忘记他们为我们作出的牺牲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-statueRWoman-2636": "WOMAN: 你能想象吗……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-statueRBoy-2637": "BOY: 我不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-statueROldman-2638": "MAN: 曾祖母以前常给我讲那个时候的故事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-statueROldwoman-2639": "WOMAN: 我有张那时候的老照片，城里还有一半是废墟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialShh-2640": "MAN: 嘘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLwoman-2641": "WOMAN: 那时候，我的祖先是从南方迁来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLboy-2642": "BOY: 还要多久？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLgrandma-2643": "WOMAN: 该多久，就多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-memorialLittleGirl-2644": "GIRL: 我不喜欢这双鞋，脚疼……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serennpcs.yarn-parkBoy1a-2645": "BOY: 不，我才要你过去呢，有胆就去啊。"
}
